    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active now",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertname=~\"Qsrv.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Firing and pending qsrv alerts with their labels.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "Alert",
              "alertstate": "State",
              "severity": "Severity",
              "queue": "Queue",
              "instance": "Instance",
              "route": "Route",
              "file": "File",
              "event": "Event"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "alertstate": 1,
              "severity": 2,
              "queue": 3,
              "instance": 4
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "No qsrv alerts active"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "State"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "text": "Firing"
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "#e0a020",
                        "text": "Pending"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Severity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": {
                        "color": "dark-red",
                        "text": "critical"
                      },
                      "warning": {
                        "color": "#e0a020",
                        "text": "warning"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Severity",
            "desc": false
          }
        ],
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "History",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (alertname, queue, instance) (ALERTS{alertname=~\"Qsrv.*\", alertstate=\"firing\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}} {{queue}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "description": "When each alert was firing over the time range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "firing",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "Nothing fired in this range"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What each alert means",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Alert | Means | Do |\n|---|---|---|\n| **QsrvDown** | Prometheus can't scrape qsrv | Check the process or container, the host, and `/healthz` |\n| **QsrvRestartLoop** | More than 2 restarts in 30 minutes | Logs at startup: a storage error, a full disk or a bad flag |\n| **QsrvHTTP5xx** | Internal errors | Logs, `unhandled error` lines |\n| **QsrvMessagesTooOld** / **Critical** | A queue's oldest message waits over 10 min / 1 h | Are consumers running? A group blocked by a message that keeps failing? Admin UI → the queue |\n| **QsrvNoConsumers** | Ready messages and nothing delivered in 10 min | Start or fix the consumers of that queue |\n| **QsrvDeadLetters** | Messages ran out of retries | Look at them in the DLQ (admin UI), fix the cause, reprocess them |\n| **QsrvMessagesExpired** | Messages waited longer than the queue's `retention` and were deleted unprocessed | Consumers down or too slow; the messages are gone (replayable only from a persistent producer queue) |\n| **QsrvDLQNotEmpty** | A dead letter queue holds messages | Same: inspect, fix, replay or delete |\n| **QsrvHighRedeliveryRatio** | Many deliveries are retries | Handlers failing, or `visibility_timeout` shorter than the work |\n| **QsrvLeaseExpiries** | Leases running out | Consumers crashing or too slow: raise `visibility_timeout` or extend leases |\n| **QsrvQueueNearFull** | A queue is close to `max_messages` | Consumers are behind; sends will get 429 |\n| **QsrvSendsRejected** | Sends getting 429 | A queue is full |\n| **QsrvDiskSpaceLow** / **Critical** / **WillFill** | Disk filling up | Drain backlogs, delete unused persistent queues, grow the volume, check the WAL |\n| **QsrvStorageFull** | qsrv refuses sends (below `-min-free-disk`) | Free space now; sends resume within seconds |\n| **QsrvBackupStale** | No snapshot in two intervals | Logs `snapshot failed`: backup disk full or not writable |\n| **QsrvSlowCommits** | fsync is slow | Disk saturated or degraded (EBS burst credits, noisy neighbour) |\n| **QsrvWriterBacklog** | Writes queueing for the disk | Disk can't keep up with the load |\n| **QsrvWALGrowing** | The WAL is not checkpointed | A long reader (big replay, a backup tool) holds it |\n| **QsrvMemoryHigh** | Resident memory high | Many live messages: consumers are behind |\n\nThresholds are in `deploy/prometheus/alerts.yml` (marked `TUNE`)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
